  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Powering Eswatini&#x2019;s Delivery Engine: The Citizen-Centred UniPod for Jobs, MSME Growth, Digital Innovation &amp; Accountable Service Delivery,&#x201d; seeks to address Eswatini&#x2019;s persistent challenges of high youth unemployment, low MSME productivity, and weak execution capacity across public institutions. The UniPod&#x2014;hosted at the University of Eswatini (UNESWA)&#x2014;is envisioned as a national delivery mechanism that integrates skills development, innovation, enterprise upgrading, and digital governance so</narrative>
  </description>
